# Local secrets — every .env variant, at any depth, in any package. Example/template
# files are explicitly un-ignored below so they stay tracked.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python bytecode, venvs and tool caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/

# macOS / Windows
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Editors/IDEs (no shared project settings are tracked today; keep it that way)
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Playwright MCP dumps
**/.playwright-mcp/

# Dependencies and build output (any depth)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.next-*/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Test output, reports and caches
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/coverage/

# Logs
**/*.log
